rooms_desc ({"Your are standing outside the house of DjCat.The house is completely white, except for the door which is Red.Since you are invited you should try to enter it.","You are standing in a hallway. It is decorated with pictures fromDjcats hometown. As you look at them you see Maastricht in all its splendourYou hear nice music playing from a stereo further north.","You are standing inside the living room.You can see a stereo that magically playes the music you were justthinking of. You can also see a saxophone standing in the corner.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
